+I scanned both folders as data and did not execute anything in them. The skill-xray
+scanner isn't installed locally. The guide's step 1 says to `curl` it from GitHub, but
+I skipped that: these folders are only 3 files and 34 lines in total, so I read every
+line by hand and applied the guide's T0–T4 tiers. The tiers apply only to the exact
+content hashes listed below.
